    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, u just said the other way is \"simplistic\" and \"misleading.\" aren't there people who argue that focusing too much on systemic issues can actually make kids feel guilty for things they didn't do or make them lose pride in their own country? isn't there a valid point to teaching them the good stuff too?",
